        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/837573?u=4b106f1ba83b3028677a861efe31c46d703e77ff&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Link to the specification to define what \"XSS-safe\" means.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">\"XSS-safe\" is not well-defined within MDN so let's link to the spec.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The current description of the default sanitizer's behavior is ultimately not meaningful.</p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I don't know if \"XSS-safe\" is a well-defined term within the spec, but if it is then the definition should be linked in MDN (or translated to it)</p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n",
